  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agriculture for Jobs in Mozambique - Investment and Finance</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Build the pipeline of investable businesses as well as provide direct support to private firms in the agricultural sector. Provide technical assistance in the form of business development services to support companies to expand their out-grower operations and strengthen climate resilience amongst the out growers/smallholders with whom they work. Provide direct support to private firms in the agriculture sector. This will include administrating grants, conduct market assessment and evaluation of business financing needs; and partnering and facilitating investment to agri-SMEs, including green financing.</narrative>
  </description>
